    {
      "aliases": [
        "SKY_HARD_INTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Haha, respected fools, I noticed your airship has changed.",
              "zh": "哈哈，尊敬的蠢货们，我注意到你们的飞船有了变化"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "My new great fighter planes will take advantage of this opportunity.",
              "zh": "我的新的伟大的战机会利用好这机会的"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "It took me three whole days. Enjoy it!",
              "zh": "这可花了我整整3天时间，尽情享受吧"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Dave, what did you just do?",
              "zh": "戴夫，你刚刚干了什么？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "PLAYFUL",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I reinforced our airship! It will never crash again!!!",
              "zh": "我加固了我们的飞船，它再也不会坠落了！！！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I think that means Edgar's fighter planes will fly straight into our ship.",
              "zh": "我想这样的话，埃德加的那些战机就会直接进入飞船了"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SHOUT",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "NO!!!!! I wanted to sleep a little longer!",
              "zh": "不！！！！！我还想再多睡会呢！"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "aliases": [
        "SKY_HARD_OUTRO"
      ],
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Did you see those huge things that flew onto our airship? Terrifying!",
              "zh": "你看到那些飞到飞船上的大家伙了吗？太恐怖了"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "The gold-card plants grown in the Zen Garden were a huge help.",
              "zh": "花园中种出的金卡植物帮了大忙"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "EXCITED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "What?! Tacos??? Where?!",
              "zh": "什么？！玉米卷？？？哪里有"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "...",
              "zh": "…………"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "There's no need to stay here any longer. We must leave immediately.",
              "zh": "已经没有在这儿的必要了，必须马上离开"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "PLAYFUL",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "After all, high altitude and tacos just don't mix.",
              "zh": "毕竟高空和玉米卷不搭"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "The fighter planes... actually... failed.",
              "zh": "战机……竟然……失败了"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "It seems I need to initiate a new plan.",
              "zh": "看来要启动新的计划了"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I'll let you experience just how formidable my company's employees are.",
              "zh": "我会让你们体会到我的公司职员的厉害的"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "If they can build this fighter plane, they can definitely eat your brains!",
              "zh": "他们可以造出这个战机，就一定可以吃到你们的脑子！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SHOUT",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "See you at Z Corp, fools!",
              "zh": "Z公司见，蠢货们"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}